# Move page puts four arrows under the page to pan a zoomed page. They have
# to be on the panel, under the page, for the mode to be any use.
wait-for Try a sample comic
tap Try a sample comic
wait-for CBZ
tap-at 536,1378
wait-for Available on this reader
tap Open
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Fit page
tap Fit width
tap-id comic-zoom-in
wait-for Zoom 125%
tap Move page
wait-for Left
expect Right
expect Up
expect Down
clean
shot move-page
tap Down
wait-idle
tap Read
wait-idle
expect-missing Down
